          %h4#second_book_the_analytic_of_principles
            %strong Second Book.
            The Analytic of Principles
          %h5#appendix_on_the_amphiboly_of_the_concepts_of_reflection_through_the_confusion_of_the_empirical_use_of_the_understanding_with_the_transcendental
            %em Appendix.
            On the amphiboly of the concepts of reflection through the confusion of the empirical use of the understanding with the transcendental.
          %blockquote#identity_difference
            %ol
              %li
                %strong Identity
                and
