                  %strong difference
                %strong numerical difference
                of the object (of the senses) itself. (
                %a{:href => "https://de.wikisource.org/wiki/Seite:Kant_Critik_der_reinen_Vernunft_263.png"}> A263
                \/B319)
          %h2#ii_transcendental_doctrine_of_methods
            %strong II. Transcendental Doctrine of Methods.
          %h2#on_aristotelian_logic On Aristotelian logic
          %p
            Regarding
            = succeed ":" do
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Aristotelian+logic"} Aristotelian logic
          %blockquote
            %p
              %em Concepts [Begriffe] … serve as predicates of possible judgements.
              (
              %a{:href => "https://de.wikisource.org/wiki/Seite:Kant_Critik_der_reinen_Vernunft_069.png"}> A69
              \/B94)
          %p
            Compare to the identification of concepts with the
            %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/types"} types
